<Layout
  title="House Cleaning Services Phoenix AZ | Diaz Cleaning LLC"
  description="Professional house cleaning in Phoenix, AZ. Residential deep cleaning, regular maintenance & more. Trusted & affordable. Call (480) 479-4507 today."
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="service-hero">
      <h1>House Cleaning Services in Phoenix, AZ</h1>
      <p class="service-subtitle">Professional, reliable and affordable residential cleaning for Phoenix and surrounding areas.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Quote</a>
    </section>

    <section class="service-content">
      <h2>Why Choose Diaz Cleaning LLC?</h2>
      <p>Diaz Cleaning LLC provides top-quality house cleaning services throughout Phoenix, AZ and the greater Maricopa County area. Whether you need a one-time deep clean or regular maintenance, our team delivers exceptional results every time.</p>

      <h2>Our Residential Cleaning Services Include:</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Deep cleaning of all rooms</li>
        <li>Kitchen and bathroom sanitization</li>
        <li>Floor cleaning and mopping</li>
        <li>Dusting and vacuuming</li>
        <li>Window and surface cleaning</li>
        <li>Move-in / move-out cleaning</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Serving All Phoenix Neighborhoods</h2>
      <p>We serve homeowners across Phoenix, Glendale, Scottsdale, Tempe, Mesa, Chandler, Peoria, Surprise, Avondale and Goodyear. No matter where you are in the Valley, Diaz Cleaning LLC is ready to help.</p>

      <h2>Affordable House Cleaning in Phoenix</h2>
      <p>We believe every home deserves a professional clean. Our rates are competitive and transparent — no hidden fees. Contact us today for a free quote tailored to your home's needs.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="service-cta">
      <h2>Ready for a Spotless Home?</h2>
      <p>Call us at <a href="tel:+14804794507">(480) 479-4507</a> or fill out our contact form and we'll get back to you the same day.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn-primary">Book Now</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

